{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 2, :comments ["<b>They are the princes of the tribes, they who stood over the numbered.</b> And because they were so, each of them offered on behalf of his tribe and its people: for in that they stood over the numbered, each one perceived concerning his tribe that some of them were suspect in transgressions, and in that they were princes, they agreed to stand in the breach and to offer sacrifices to make atonement on their behalf."], :book :numbers, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 7, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:38:52.380689346Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}